# what the add button makes: "photo", "video", "audio" or "write". How you
# work, not what you own — device-scoped exactly as /browse's `view` is, and a
# device-scoped write queues no op. "write" is the default because it is the
# one kind that asks the phone for nothing.
mode: String = "write".to_string() (device, last-write, own)
